###############################################################################
# Q12 -- Gaps and ambiguities (prose; not triples)
###############################################################################

# - A pure application of a commercial pretrained model: PFP v1.19.0 is a later release than the PFP model of takamoto2022pfp (paper-local there), so no registry model is linked; EqV2-ODAC is used only to pre-relax structures. The quantities compared with DFT are adsorption enthalpies and Henry coefficients, for which schema 0.1.2 has no MetricProperty.
# - Monte Carlo (Widom insertion) and geometry optimisation with a pretrained model would be mlips:supportsSimulation statements on a method, but the paper applies no method in a training run, so nothing is asserted.
# - Read from the arXiv v1 preprint, not the Chemical Science version.
# - Author affiliations are not encoded (ORCIDs are those deposited with the DOI metadata, source: crossref).
